      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-07-31T18:07:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure we need the `-Os`. Skia is already picking optimization levels in general and we should use the defaults from the build.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "startChar": 21,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 24
